{
  "id": "030d76d0c15a43e53b6b7eac",
  "title": "我和他的日常.小胖惨遭偷家，那只老来的柴犬，以及我多么想念电报",
  "summary": "01小胖惨遭偷家 橘子今天在跟我疯狂吐槽那个经常来院子的柴犬，柴犬知道橘子不让她偷小胖的吃的，于是她采取了各种策略。 比如今日，有朋友在院子外面跟橘子说话，柴犬观察片刻后发现橘子顾不上管她，她顿时一头扎进我们的院子几口把小胖盆里的牛肉吃光，再火速逃离现场，继续在院子外面坐着看橘子和朋友说话。 橘子用余光目睹了一切，说坏了，小胖的饭没了。 【小胖外出去散步了，惨遭偷家】 *** *** 柴犬知道橘子不允许她偷小胖的饭吃，每次橘子大骂不许她偷饭时，她就灰溜溜地走了。 但是，柴犬觉得只有橘子一个人可以骂她要求她走。 当橘子的老母亲开始骂她，要求她走时，柴犬就站在原地和老母亲大声地对骂。 这……某种意义上，柴犬也很厉害啊…… *** *** 我一般不骂柴犬，我看见柴犬偷我的厨房垃圾桶，才一指她，柴犬马上咧开嘴腆着脸贴…",
  "content": "<div><h4><span><span><span><span><u><span><span><span><span><span><span>01小胖惨遭偷家</span></span></span></span></span></span></u></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子今天在跟我疯狂吐槽那个经常来院子的柴犬，柴犬知道橘子不让她偷小胖的吃的，于是她采取了各种策略。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>比如今日，有朋友在院子外面跟橘子说话，柴犬观察片刻后发现橘子顾不上管她，她顿时一头扎进我们的院子几口把小胖盆里的牛肉吃光，再火速逃离现场，继续在院子外面坐着看橘子和朋友说话。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子用余光目睹了一切，说坏了，小胖的饭没了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>【小胖外出去散步了，惨遭偷家】</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>*** ***</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>柴犬知道橘子不允许她偷小胖的饭吃，每次橘子大骂不许她偷饭时，她就灰溜溜地走了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>但是，柴犬觉得只有橘子一个人可以骂她要求她走。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>当橘子的老母亲开始骂她，要求她走时，柴犬就站在原地和老母亲大声地对骂。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这……某种意义上，柴犬也很厉害啊……</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>*** ***</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我一般不骂柴犬，我看见柴犬偷我的厨房垃圾桶，才一指她，柴犬马上咧开嘴腆着脸贴到我腿上，开始耍赖皮了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>柴犬是真聪明啊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>她简直是农村社会化高阶玩家。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>02阴阳怪气老母亲</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>老太太下午发现黑猫跑到邻居家里去了，她顿感焦虑，叫我去把猫召回。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>拜托，邻居那一片土地都是猫自认为的领地，召回猫干嘛？我没有动弹，压力传导到橘子身上，于是橘子去露台大喊猫的名字：煤球！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>煤球高高兴兴在邻居的土地上应了，黑猫嗷嗷哇哇喊着，仅用两分钟就冲回了客厅，橘子给她挤了猫条吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>吃完之后，猫又不见了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子说：不会又去邻居家了吧？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>很有可能哦。这是一场只有煤球受益的白忙活。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>*** ***</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>老太太说她那间房的空调洞口有老鼠在悉悉索索地爬，她要求橘子给她堵上。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子在家里到处翻堵洞用的硅胶泥，因为找的时间略长，老太太因此对他开启了嘲讽模式，大意是这么晚了你个没用的东西还在磨蹭竟然还不去堵，你随便找个铁皮盒子爬上去塞在那里就可以。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子憋着气，终于找到了一箱硅胶泥，他搭好梯子爬上去堵空调洞口。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>此时，老太太又在旁边喊：哎呀，天太晚了，今天要不就不要搞了吧！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>提问：老太太是不是有病？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><b><u><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></u></b></div><div><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>03我妈学不会好好说话</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我妈有时候说话特别伤人，她有一次大骂我不生小孩，然后说我会得乳腺癌。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>【还好老子成长了，不然真的很悲痛啊，好吗？现在我不悲痛了~随她去吧】</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><b><u><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></u></b></div><div><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>04狗子的日常</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>早晨打开屋门，小胖很高兴地要去院子外散步。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>抬头一看院子，一只别人家的狗（柴犬）已经躺在院子里了，那狗看见我起床非常高兴，满脸笑容凑过来用鼻头触我的手。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>随后，小胖和别人家的狗就一起快快乐乐地去散步了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><u><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>05挑嘴的小胖</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></u></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子把屋门打开没过多久，屋里就多出来一只狗。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>多一只狗的意思是，除了我们自己养的狗子小胖之外，屋里还进来一只别人家的狗（柴犬），它若无其事地躺在我们屋里呼呼大睡，享受一下空调的凉气。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>做肉馅的时候，将两块猪皮切了下来。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我把煮好煮软的猪皮切好切成了小块，小胖闻了一下，很挑剔地不吃（小胖，你是什么富贵狗啊，这也不吃那也不吃）。柴犬立马颠颠地奔过来吃了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>06别人家的柴犬</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>最近村里别人养的柴犬天天来我们院子玩耍。小柴玩耍的时间逐渐延长，这两日更是一天八到十个小时蹲在我们这里。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小柴早上八点多就来我们门口等着，一开门就冲进屋，随后大多数时间都在我们屋里转悠，躺着纳凉，吃小胖的狗粮，吃猫不喜欢吃的冻干鹌鹑和猫条……总之，这只小柴就是不回自己的家。它简直是在我们这里上班啊。等到傍晚七点八点，小柴才起身慢吞吞回家。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小柴这是多不喜欢自己的家啊，它的主人到底是怎么在养狗的啊……</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>07吃百家饭的柴犬</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>前几天来的那只小柴犬现在日日都来了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子说是村头某户养的，因为总是看见小柴犬从那个方向的小路欢快地跑上来。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这只小柴是个妹妹。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>现在固定每天来吃一轮小胖的狗粮，找我卖萌吃几根猫条，很多时间在我们屋子里躺着睡觉。临近黄昏了，再乐颠颠回自己家去。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小柴的生活质量很高啊，凭借一己之力，给自己找了两个家。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>08柴犬又来了</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>昨天光顾我们院子的半大柴犬又来了，它一脸喜气洋洋，要和小胖玩，小胖凶了它一声。柴犬也不紧张，又喜气洋洋地来到我跟前，要我给它挤猫条吃。猫条挤出来还没有掉到盆里，它已经吧唧吧唧两下吃完了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小胖不喜欢吃这个牌子的猫条，但是不妨碍它看着柴犬吃生气，于是小胖又大声吵起柴犬来。喜气洋洋的柴犬吃完猫条，还乐颠颠去木工房找我弟玩了一会儿。它来回在院子里玩了一个多小时候，才欢快地离开了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>其间小胖一直不高兴。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>09这是柴犬初次出现，本文章是倒叙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>不知是谁家的柴犬冲进了我们的院子。看起来是个半大犬，脖子上戴着项圈。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>柴犬猛猛狂吃小胖的饭，把小胖的狗盆舔得发亮。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>舔完小胖的盆，柴犬还想要吃的，于是我给它连续开了4根猫条，还吃了许多冻干小鹌鹑。这会儿柴犬终于饱了，屁颠颠地又浪出去了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><h4><span><span><b><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>010我的小白猫被毒死了</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b></span></span></h4><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>之前，我停更了很久。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>因为我的小白猫被村民到处投放的剧毒鼠药毒死了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我哭了很多个月，人太过抑郁，所以停止了更新。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>现在一想到被毒死的小白猫，我还是忍不住掉眼泪。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>现在，我只剩这只胖胖的黑猫了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小白猫名叫电报，因为他会啊啊啊这样叠声叫，像个电报发报机。电报是个公猫，也是捡回来的，当时给他做完了绝育手术，恢复得很好。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们以为会和电报一起度过漫长的十五年。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>电报特别喜欢橘子，每天粘在橘子身上，要摸，要搂着睡觉，要玩耍。橘子刷牙时，电报就守在他旁边，歪着头研究水为何流到下水口就消失无踪了，假以时日，电报是会成为物理学家的天才小猫咪。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小白猫性格非常阳光灿烂，充满了热情，每天早晨，电报会跟所有的人热情打一轮招呼。电报比黑猫探索的领地更大更远。但没有想到村民们在那一周投放了那么多剧毒鼠药。小白猫的生命就这样戛然而止了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这种感觉太可怕了，胸口被挖掉很大一块。无论何时回忆起我们找到小白猫口鼻淌血，小小的躯体正在变得僵硬的场景，眼泪都跟着吧嗒吧嗒掉下来。 2025年12月9日，是小白猫被毒死的日子。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我和橘子决定只要我们还住在这个到处有人投毒的土地上，我们就再也不养新的小猫了。哪怕捡到小猫，也送到市区去找人领养。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>",
